     1,
     "<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">Hi,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">   I am having trouble on converting the annotation of LFQ and TMT phospho analysis on R package &quot;MSstatsPTM&quot;.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">   I downloaded example data from &quot;</span><a href=\"https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstatsPTM/tree/master/data\" style=\"font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstatsPTM/tree/master/data&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230976528000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3L3fxugo-B9bohA755OTdQ\">https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstatsPTM/tree/master/data</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">&quot;, and tried maxq_tmt and maxq_lf files by lines bellow but R returned with similar errors as &quot;Error in MaxQtoMSstatsPTMFormat(annotation = maxq_tmt_annotation, evidence = maxq_tmt_evidence,  : argument 2 matches multiple formal arguments&quot; or &quot;Error in MaxQtoMSstatsPTMFormat(evidence = maxq_lf_evidence, annotation = maxq_lf_annotation,  : argument 2 matches multiple formal arguments&quot;. Can U give some adivices to sovle this error?</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">   </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;