     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>I believe this is caused by the 3rd argument `fasta`. The converter calls for the argument `fasta_path`. Can you try to swap this out and see if the issue is fixed?</div><div><br></div><div>Devon<br><br></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thursday, May 25, 2023 at 12:42:08 AM UTC-4 <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mao...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">Hi,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">   I am having trouble on converting the annotation of LFQ and TMT phospho analysis on R package &quot;MSstatsPTM&quot;.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">   I downloaded example data from &quot;</span><a href=\"https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstatsPTM/tree/master/data\" style=\"font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstatsPTM/tree/master/data&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230976536000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1w1D0WVAN0UL82yT_xClGH\">https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstatsPTM/tree/master/data</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋体,arial,Verdana,sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px\">&quot;, and tried maxq_tmt and maxq_lf files by lines bellow but R returned with similar errors as &quot;Error in MaxQtoMSstatsPTMFormat(annotation = maxq_tmt_annotation, evidence = maxq_tmt_evidence,  : argument 2 matches multiple formal arguments&quot; or &quot;Error in MaxQtoMSstatsPTMFormat(evidence = maxq_lf_evidence, annotation = maxq_lf_annotation,  : argument 2 matches multiple formal arguments&quot;. Can U give some adivices to sovle this error?</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:宋